PRIVATE BUILD — DO NOT DISTRIBUTE
=================================

This Station Manager package was built on the PRIVATE (keyed) build path
(scripts/dev-rpm.sh) and has the shared ClubLog application API key baked into
its binary. That key is extractable with `strings` and is acceptable ONLY for
the private dogfood model (ADR 0054).

Therefore this package MUST NOT be:
  - published or uploaded as a release/CI artifact,
  - copied into a support bundle or a shared location,
  - installed anywhere the binary could be read by another party.

Distributable, key-free packages are produced by the PUBLIC build path,
scripts/release-rpm.sh (or scripts/release.sh). This marker never contains the
key itself — it only records that the accompanying binary does.
